          "text": "micrograd is an autograd engine: it implements backpropagation."
        },
        {
          "t": 95,
          "text": "The README example: a and b wrapped in Value and built into a long expression."
        },
        {
          "t": 166,
          "text": "The forward pass: g.data is 24.7.",
          "action": [
            "#ov-fwd"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": 201,
          "text": "g.backward() walks backwards and applies the chain rule.",
          "action": [
            "#ov-bwd"
          ]
        },
