          "t": 558,
          "text": "The parabola plotted with x from −5 to 5 in steps of 0.25 (the picture above)."
        },
        {
          "t": 594,
          "text": "Why nobody writes out a network's derivative by hand.",
          "anchor": "means"
        },
        {
          "t": 629,
